  "thesis": "Calling a chatbot's apology 'bullshit' commits Magnus, Buccella and D'Cruz to the Austinian view that an apology can be performed without remorse, and so to the claim that the chatbot performs the speech act of apologising, which is exactly what their title thesis denies.",
